OL,3,GNEWSA'It's not Alton Towers' - rows
OL,4,Aover waiting in line at Wales' highest
OL,5,Amountain
OL,6,
OL,7,FVisitors to Wales' highest mountain are
OL,8,Fbeing urged to respect others by not
OL,9,Fjumping queues to reach the summit.
OL,11,FRecent videos from Yr Wyddfa, also
OL,12,Fknown as Snowdon, on social media have
OL,13,Fshown rows breaking out between those
OL,14,Fwaiting their turn and others skipping
OL,15,Fthe line to reach a metal plate that
OL,16,Fmarks the top.
OL,18,FMarc Screeton, from Manchester, posted
OL,19,Fa video showing him being heckled as he
OL,20,Fbypassed the line, saying: "Imagine
OL,21,Fqueuing on a mountain? No chance."
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
